committed) from Lucide (lucide 0.564.0 and lucide-react 0.564.0, ISC, Lucide Contributors; portions
from Feather, MIT, Cole Bemis), the file icons of @pierre/trees 1.0.0-beta.4 (Apache-2.0, Copyright
